// interval-union — three defects in one head: the `int` type prefix, the `..`
// span and the `|` union. This is the shape LANGUAGE.md:348 and README.md:26
// both display, which is why it is the one the promise is judged on.
module IntervalUnion

public atom Classify(int)
Classify(>= 200 and < 300) -> :ok
Classify(>= 400 and < 500) -> :client_error
Classify(>= 500)           -> :server_error
